ys God is sitting  there talking about the things that he  doesn't like he says why have they  fasted they say and you have not seen it  why have we why have we humbled  ourselves and you have not noticed yet  on the day of your fashion you do as you  please and you exploit all your workers  your fasting ends in quarreling and  strife and in striking each other with  wicked fists you cannot fast as you do  today and expect your voice to be heard  on high now this is the kind of fast  that I want you to do this is one  constant this is this is the real kind  of fast of a day to Humble himself it is  it is only for bowing one's head like a  reed and for lying on sackcloth and  ashes is this what you call a fast this  is where he says is is not this kind of  fasi and I have chosen to loose the  chains of injustice to untie the cords  of the yoke to set your press free and  break every yoke is it not to share your  food with the hungry and to provide the  poor wanderer with shelter when you see  the naked to clothe them not to turn  away from your own flesh and blood  then your light will break forth like  the dawn and you're heading and your  Healy and we'll quickly appear then your  righteousness will go before you and the  glory of the Lord will be your rear  guard and it goes on and on and on  that's Isaiah 58 so my wife and I were  reading that and I went out to a few of  my friends people that I trusted people  that were wise and I said look I'm  thinking about fasting I'm not going to  eat nobody's ever done this in Congress  it seems kind of strange and you know I  don't want to look like a clown but what  do you think of this and you know they  liked it so this was a way I didn't tell  anybody that this was my inspiration  because if I did that they would  probably censor me and throw me out of  the Congress but based on this and based  on the fact that my wife was with me and  some of my friends I went before the  Congress the United States outside the  capital and I said look this place  doesn't have a conscience about these  issues and I am going to stop eating no  I'm not going to hurt myself but I'm  going to stop eating and I'm not going  to do anything I'm not going to do  anything until something good happens on  hunger because I'm sick and tired of  this place you know taken away these  kind of issues when in fact this is one  of the more important issues that we can  deal with so I'm thinking well this is  the end of my career nobody will ever  understand this my staff thought Tony  you'll never get elected on this one  people won't understand this and I  didn't really try to explain it so I  went back to Ohio I thought I figured  well how I might as well face the music  and get it over with and so I went back  to all my press back there and I just  happened to be speaking to a high school  that day and I explained to them what I  was doing and and why and very  interesting they all decided to fast  with me everybody in the high school  students  faculty and their families now they did  I fasted for 22 days I didn't need for  22 days I just drank water they took two  or three days amazing thing about it is  that caught on and there was about  10,000 high schools that fasted with us  couple hundred universities and the  press began to write about it in a very  interesting way and a very wonderful way  very warm way both on the left on the  right I'm really surprised and a lot of  good things began to happen a lot of  programs started the legislation was  starting to pass people really being  cognizant not so much in the Congress  because there's they still don't know  what to make of this guy that's  fascinating a don't understand this one  anyway a lot of good things are  happening around the country and in the  end the thing that really got me to quit  is the the world bank called me and they  said you know we're very moved by this  fast we've been reading about it and we  were going to have a world conference 