 know you're going to hit a lot of you  got one of the finest Prime Minister's  here in the world he's just been an  amazing man what he's done and so you're  going to hear a lot of talk and a lot of  discussion about faith and globalization  but the one thing I want you to do if  you think about it just do the thing is  in front of it you you don't all have to  go to Calcutta you don't all you've got  all kinds of problems here in New Haven  and just do that one thing if everybody  did that one thing half the stuff we do  in government we wouldn't need but we  don't do it so those are things i want  to leave you with I'm trying to give you  the idea of how does faith work this is  the way I think it works I think you  have to experience that I think you have  to walk around in and I think you got to  do the thing that's in front of you I  think you got to trust God and if you do  this and if you do it with sincerity  you're going to be amazed what happens  so that's what I wanted to say to you  today thank you very much
 

